### Puppet toolchain (masterless: puppet apply, no server) ###
  puppet 7.20.0
  facter 4.2.13
  ruby   ruby 2.7.6p219 (2022-04-12 revision c9c2245c0a) [x86_64-linux]
  node   Ubuntu 22.04.5 LTS

  Installed by puppet/lab/build-puppet-node.sh, which extracts the
  self-contained /opt/puppetlabs tree from the official container
  image. apt.puppet.com is refused by this lab's egress policy, and
  the Ubuntu universe package is Puppet 5.5 -- too old for EPP and
  the modern data types this module uses.

