### External module dependencies: NONE ###
  forgeapi.puppet.com is unreachable and not fixably so -- Puppet's
  bundled Ruby ignores both SSL_CERT_FILE and --ssl_trust_store. The
  two stdlib features the module needed are reimplemented locally:
    Stdlib_absolutepath -> modules/attendance/types/absolutepath.pp
    assert_private()    -> modules/attendance/functions/assert_private.pp

